# sweep: --bare --seed-root apps/lichess/fixtures/puzzles
# A puzzle's verdict belongs to that puzzle: the next one opens without it.
tap Puzzles
wait-for 3 puzzles are waiting.
tap Resume puzzle
wait-for-id skip-puzzle
tap-id square-e2
tap-id square-e3
expect Not it. Try again.
tap-id square-e2
tap-id square-e4
wait-for Not solved
expect The first move was R
expect-missing e2e8
clean
shot puzzle-verdict
tap Next puzzle
wait-for-id skip-puzzle
expect White
expect-missing Not solved
expect-missing The first move was
clean
shot puzzle-next-clean
